  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0028",
    "start_seconds": 67.36,
    "end_seconds": 72.72,
    "text": "then automatically use these models when"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0029",
    "start_seconds": 70.08,
    "end_seconds": 74.36,
    "text": "set to auto routing. There are a myriad"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0030",
    "start_seconds": 72.72,
    "end_seconds": 77.28,
    "text": "of scenarios where local models are"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0031",
    "start_seconds": 74.36,
    "end_seconds": 80.56,
    "text": "perfect and the inference is completely"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0032",
    "start_seconds": 77.28,
    "end_seconds": 82.88,
    "text": "free for you. For instance, when set to"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0033",
    "start_seconds": 80.56,
    "end_seconds": 84.88,
    "text": "auto routing, Copilot can automatically"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0034",
    "start_seconds": 82.88,
    "end_seconds": 87.47999999999999,
    "text": "offload to a local model for simple"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0035",
    "start_seconds": 84.88,
    "end_seconds": 89.67999999999999,
    "text": "tasks such as explaining how a code base"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0036",
    "start_seconds": 87.48,
    "end_seconds": 92.04,
    "text": "works or how to run a project. You can"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0037",
    "start_seconds": 89.68,
    "end_seconds": 94.36000000000001,
    "text": "also plan with large frontier models"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0038",
    "start_seconds": 92.04,
    "end_seconds": 96.28,
    "text": "such as Astra and then hand off to a"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0039",
    "start_seconds": 94.36,
    "end_seconds": 97.88,
    "text": "local model to implement while you"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0040",
    "start_seconds": 96.28,
    "end_seconds": 100.6,
    "text": "sleep."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0041",
    "start_seconds": 97.88,
    "end_seconds": 102.75999999999999,
    "text": "End users love automations in GitHub"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0042",
    "start_seconds": 100.6,
    "end_seconds": 105.55999999999999,
    "text": "Copilot. These are tasks that run on a"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0043",
    "start_seconds": 102.76,
    "end_seconds": 107.80000000000001,
    "text": "schedule in the background. Local models"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0044",
    "start_seconds": 105.56,
    "end_seconds": 110.16,
    "text": "work incredibly here, able to work on"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0045",
    "start_seconds": 107.8,
    "end_seconds": 115.12,
    "text": "very long-running tasks and costing you"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0046",
    "start_seconds": 110.16,
    "end_seconds": 117.56,
    "text": "exactly zero AI credits to use."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0047",
    "start_seconds": 115.12,
    "end_seconds": 119.36,
    "text": "You can also go completely offline and"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0048",
    "start_seconds": 117.56,
    "end_seconds": 121.04,
    "text": "still have access to your local models,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0049",
    "start_seconds": 119.36,
    "end_seconds": 123.68,
    "text": "which is perfect for working"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0050",
    "start_seconds": 121.04,
    "end_seconds": 125.4,
    "text": "disconnected or when you just don't have"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0051",
    "start_seconds": 123.68,
    "end_seconds": 128.03900000000002,
    "text": "an internet connection."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0052",
    "start_seconds": 125.4,
    "end_seconds": 129.96,
    "text": "Project Hydro Fusion is available today"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0053",
    "start_seconds": 128.039,
    "end_seconds": 132.6,
    "text": "in GitHub Copilot. You can look for it"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0054",
    "start_seconds": 129.96,
    "end_seconds": 135.12,
    "text": "under experimental settings. And capable"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0055",
    "start_seconds": 132.6,
    "end_seconds": 138.6,
    "text": "devices will be able to use intelligent"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0056",
    "start_seconds": 135.12,
    "end_seconds": 142.28,
    "text": "local model routing very soon, including"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0057",
    "start_seconds": 138.6,
    "end_seconds": 145.12,
    "text": "MAI Code 1.1 flash. With GitHub Copilot,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0058",
    "start_seconds": 142.28,
    "end_seconds": 147.6,
    "text": "you get intelligent multi-model routing"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0059",
    "start_seconds": 145.12,
    "end_seconds": 149.84,
    "text": "both in the cloud and very soon with"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0060",
    "start_seconds": 147.6,
    "end_seconds": 154.0,
    "text": "local models that run on your machine"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0061",
    "start_seconds": 149.84,
    "end_seconds": 154.0,
    "text": "and cost you exactly $0.00."
